<title>UK: CRT sees H1 sales ahead of last year.</title>
<headline>CRT sees H1 sales ahead of last year.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Training services firm CRT Group Plc said it expects turnover in the first half to be &quot;comfortably&quot; ahead of last year.</p>
<p>&quot;As a result the board believes that CRT will report a satisfactory first half performance when compared with the same period last year,&quot; chairman Thomas Kalinske told the group's annual meeting.</p>
<p>He said CRT would be making a series of acquisitions over the next six months as part of expansion plans.</p>
<p>CRT's shares were up 1p at 250-1/2 by 1014 GMT.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
